  "body": "i really like this software and i try to switch from rawtherapee to ART, despite it is so slow. But it is perfect for my workflow and exporting to jxl, which is not possible with rawtherapee.\n\ni have lots of hi-res pictures (**50 MP JPG -> deconvolution -> geometrical corrections -> scale down to 27 MP -> export as jxl**)\n\noften 100 - 200 pictures in the export queue. It happens often, that the export stops after some or after many pictures and there happens nothing further. The switch is ON, but it seems, that it is stopped. ART is responsible, i can put further pictures in the queue, i can work with pictures, but the queue will no further processed. Sometimes stopping and starting the queue helps, sometimes not, new start from ART an switching the queue to on works, but not for all pictures.\n\nMy standard setting is, that the queue starts automatically.\n\nThank you for your time for this project.\n\n",
